Similarly, convert the tensor index to a Python scalar using `.item()` before passing it to `set_from_flat_data_page` to avoid potential `TypeError` if the host pool's internal structures do not support PyTorch tensor indexing.

```suggestion
            for i, p in enumerate(draft_pages):
                if p is not None:
                    host_pool.set_from_flat_data_page(
                        host_indices[i * self.page_size].item(), p
                    )
```

